//absract and private combination is illegal:

abstract means:
No body
Must be implemented by child class
Child has to override it
----------------------
private mean:
Accessible only inside the same class
NOT visible to child classes
Cannot be overridden

=put them together:
This says:
“Child class MUST override this method”
“Child class CANNOT see this method”
🤯 Impossible situation.

abstract and private cannot be used together because abstract
methods must be overridden, but private methods cannot be overridden.
🟢 Extra info (good to know)
abstract + final → ❌ illegal (same reason)
private methods can exist in abstract class ✔️
Abstract class can have private concrete methods ✔️


